  "scope": "Generic organic support performance repair, source-bound normal Windows Release and unchanged project exports. No commit, push or physical printing trial.",
  "causes": [
    "Repeated full-layer round-bead offsets and unions after individual local edits",
    "Repeated checks of already validated planes and identical bearing geometry",
    "Optional cache allowance retained early-layer roads and stopped reusing later geometry",
    "Nearest-road searches rebuilt every polyline segment list for every point and scanned distant segments"
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Skip lateral morphology only when complete raw printed-material coverage is already established with nonnegative reach and a nondegenerate integer window",
    "Exact bounded round-bead reuse with bounded working-set rotation, recent erosion and bearing-result reuse, and lazy unused endpoint offsets",
    "Physical predecessor revision checks; defer final support-island rebuilding",
    "Stream one revision-bound local road index and select complete nearby beads with an erosion guard",
    "Build ordered hierarchical line bounds once per lower plane, retain original segment visit and comparison order, and use the original rounded point-on-line projection",
    "Mark expanded horizontal, vertical and point bounds valid before hierarchical merges; preserve the original tie winners"
  ],
